{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41365","headline":"游灵溪观 · 卢士衡","name":"游灵溪观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云藏宝殿风尘外，粉壁松轩入看初。\n话久仙童颜色老，病来玄鹤羽毛疎。\n樵翁接引寻红术，道士留连说紫书。\n不爲壮心降未得，便堪从此翫清虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢士衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}